$techGroup_name_gun2;Gun Technologies
$techGroup_tooltipgun2;By developing more advanced gun layouts and improved mechanisms for our gun turrets we can unlock new design options and superior rates of fire, faster turret traverse speeds, and more.
$techGroup_name_guns;Small & Medium Naval Guns
$techGroup_tooltipguns;The development of small and medium naval guns is key to improving our destroyer and cruiser forces, as well as making our capital ship's secondary weapons more effective.
